{
  "title": "Dua for Protection of Valuables and Precious Things (that are Concealed)",
  "data": "Recite [Surah al-Qadr](A101) over your savings to keep them guarded.\nAfter reciting one hundred verses of the Holy Qur’an, repeat this word 7 times:\nيَا اَللهُ\nYAA ALLAAH\nO Allah,",
  "merits": "Quoted from 'Uddat al-Da'i, the Holy Imams (a) are reported to have said that the savings on which [Surah al-Qadr](A101) is recited will be guarded.\n\nImam Ali, Amir al-Mu'minin (a), is also reported to have said: whoever recites one hundred verses of the Holy Qur'an and follows it by repeating this word seven times, will be able to uproot even a rock if he prays Almighty Allah for so:"
}
